      "snippet": "- Logging: every set_category prints old→new transition + previous_owner in JSON ### Option A — Tag Switching (not Option B) - When human-owned chat (ahsan/ahmed/imran/rafay) goes cold: category switches to followup/junk - Owner name auto-saved to `previous_owner` column — never lost - One tag per chat at all times — no multi-tag rows ### TOOLS.md — Fully rewritten - Two-field design documented: category + cadence_status - Valid categories table, cadence statuses table - Commands documented: set-category, set-cadence-status, list-customers - Tagging-by-flow matrix - TODO: swap for real WhatsApp Business API labels ### MEMORY.md — Follow-Up State Tracking section added - Template format fo",
